# light-notices store snapshot (lighting plan 3d)
# dimensions: cause x transition x setting(any/outdoor/indoor) x index

movement|darker_faces|any|0 => You step out of the glare, and your eyes ease.
movement|darker_faces|any|1 => The glare falls behind you; faces are easy to read again.
movement|darker_shapes|any|0 => You step into dimmer light; faces blur into shapes.
movement|darker_shapes|any|1 => The light thins here; you can make out shapes, not faces.
movement|darker_dark|any|0 => You step into darkness.
movement|darker_dark|any|1 => The light falls away behind you, and you can see nothing.
movement|lighter_shapes|any|0 => You step into faint light; shapes come out of the dark.
movement|lighter_shapes|any|1 => There is a little light here; you can make out shapes.
movement|lighter_faces|any|0 => You step into the light; faces are clear now.
movement|lighter_faces|any|1 => The light is better here; you can make out faces.
movement|dazzled|any|0 => You step into light so bright it stabs at your eyes.
movement|dazzled|any|1 => The glare here is too much for your eyes.
carried|darker_faces|any|0 => The glare of the carried light is gone, and your eyes ease.
carried|darker_faces|any|1 => With the bright light gone, your eyes stop aching.
