carried|lighter_faces|any|0 => A carried light spreads around you; faces are clear now.
carried|lighter_faces|any|1 => By the carried light, you can make out faces.
carried|dazzled|any|0 => With the carried light added, the glare stabs at your eyes.
carried|dazzled|any|1 => The carried light tips the brightness into a glare that hurts.
