lamp|dazzled|any|0 => The lamplight stabs at your eyes.
lamp|dazzled|any|1 => The lamps flare too bright for your eyes.
weather|darker_faces|any|0 => Clouds cut the glare, and your eyes ease.
weather|darker_faces|any|1 => The weather dims the glare; your eyes stop aching.
weather|darker_shapes|any|0 => The weather dims the light; faces blur into shapes.
